    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/e34e323b381340e9c95780e808113a2e.avif?t=1667034449\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dream, time, and memories </h2><strong>Mom and dad are disappeared!</strong> In the middle of night, while a girl woke up and wandering around home, she fell on the rusty garbage dump. Can Sowon go back to her world out from this strange world?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/7069759b36f4a91f896d772e047f073f.poster.avif?t=1667034449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/7069759b36f4a91f896d772e047f073f.webm?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/7069759b36f4a91f896d772e047f073f.mp4?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3161Got an invitation from the ugliest doll!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Can Sowon wake up if she would tumble and fall?<br></li><li>In the toy world, beauty and fear coexist and all living things are toys. There also might be a toy you want.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/3383cd41f8ede63b93f725b015141f1c.poster.avif?t=1667034449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/3383cd41f8ede63b93f725b015141f1c.webm?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/3383cd41f8ede63b93f725b015141f1c.mp4?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/48cbdda98d9a47cb572046c2e67dd1da.poster.avif?t=1667034449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/48cbdda98d9a47cb572046c2e67dd1da.webm?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/48cbdda98d9a47cb572046c2e67dd1da.mp4?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3161Find clues and solve puzzles with Sowon!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are many different puzzles in the toy world.<br>Don't miss any tiny clues. Use magical tools to solve puzzles.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/e92b63c25bb8df4fa4086a6c1aae2600.poster.avif?t=1667034449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/e92b63c25bb8df4fa4086a6c1aae2600.webm?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/e92b63c25bb8df4fa4086a6c1aae2600.mp4?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/bcc145dd1cfbd61653b211c53be7c0cc.avif?t=1667034449\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3161Many of the world's ugliest dolls appear in this game.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go on a wonderful trip with toys in SOWON.<br></li><li>Meet various dolls with crooked charm in the toy world!<br>Unique puzzles and whole new places you've never been are waiting for you.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/e34e323b381340e9c95780e808113a2e.avif?t=1667034449\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dream, time, and memories </h2><strong>Mom and dad are disappeared!</strong> In the middle of night, while a girl woke up and wandering around home, she fell on the rusty garbage dump. Can Sowon go back to her world out from this strange world?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/7069759b36f4a91f896d772e047f073f.poster.avif?t=1667034449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/7069759b36f4a91f896d772e047f073f.webm?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/7069759b36f4a91f896d772e047f073f.mp4?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3161Got an invitation from the ugliest doll!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Can Sowon wake up if she would tumble and fall?<br></li><li>In the toy world, beauty and fear coexist and all living things are toys. There also might be a toy you want.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/3383cd41f8ede63b93f725b015141f1c.poster.avif?t=1667034449\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/3383cd41f8ede63b93f725b015141f1c.webm?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104560/extras/3383cd41f8ede63b93f725b015141f1c.mp4?t=1667034449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video